Build 051 (diagnostic only): the 050 depth-compare probe lines (EDEN_DEPTH_SAMPLER, EDEN_DEPTH_CBUF) also go to
/data/eden-nx2/logs/depth-samplers.txt, flushed per line, because the restart after a crash empties eden_log.txt
(050 lost them). Each line carries the shader key; program keys are now recorded for every lowered program.

